§§ `Damage: the defined term`

-- The operative promise, and the one definition in the document: "Tổn hại" (Damage) is
-- physical loss and damage, or destruction, that is sudden and unforeseen ("có tính bất ngờ").
-- Fork F1: "có tính bất ngờ" qualifies all three heads, not destruction alone.
-- src:16 | BẢO MINH SẼ BỒI THƯỜNG CHO NGƯỜI ĐƯỢC BẢO HIỂM giá trị của tài sản tại thời điểm xảy ra
-- src:17 | tổn thất vật chất hoặc phá hủy hoặc phần giá trị tổn hại vật chất đó (từ “Tổn hại ” theo Quy tắc bảo hiểm
-- src:18 | này từ đây có nghĩa là tổn thất và thiệt hại vật chất hoặc bị phá hủy có tính bất ngờ). Bảo Minh cũng có
-- src:19 | thể chọn cách thay thế hoặc phục hồi toàn bộ hoặc một phần tài sản bị tổn hại đó.
@ref insuring clause, the definition of Damage (src:17-18)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the loss is Damage as defined` l MEANS
        l's `physical loss, destruction or damage`
    AND l's `sudden and unforeseen`

§§ `The period of insurance`

-- "vào bất kỳ thời điểm nào thuộc Thời hạn bảo hiểm": at any time in the period. Fork F2: both
-- the first and the last day of a period are inside it (the Schedule gives days, not hours).
@ref insuring clause (src:13-15)
GIVEN p IS A `A period`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the date falls within` p d MEANS
        d AT LEAST p's `first day`
    AND d AT MOST  p's `last day`

-- The period stated in the Schedule, or any later period for which the Insured paid the
-- premium and the Insurer accepted a renewal.
@ref insuring clause (src:13-15)
GIVEN s IS A `The Schedule`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the date falls within the period of insurance or a renewal of it` s d MEANS
        `the date falls within` (s's `the period of insurance`) d
    OR  any (GIVEN p YIELD `the date falls within` p d) (s's `renewal periods paid for and accepted`)

§§ `What the insuring clause reaches`

-- Insured property AT THE INSURED PREMISES ("tại địa điểm được bảo hiểm"), suffering Damage,
-- in a period of insurance, where the premium is paid or agreed to be paid. The fifth element,
-- "do bất kỳ nguyên nhân nào không bị hợp đồng bảo hiểm loại trừ" (by any cause not excluded),
-- is the exclusions module's answer; the claim module joins them.
@ref insuring clause (src:7-15)
GIVEN s IS A `The Schedule`
      l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the insuring clause reaches the item` s l i MEANS
        s's `the Insured has paid or agreed to pay the premium`
    AND `the loss is Damage as defined` l
    AND i's `circumstances`'s `at the insured premises`
    AND `the date falls within the period of insurance or a renewal of it` s (l's `date of the loss`)

-- A reason, given only where the condition does not hold. Used to explain each layer.
GIVEN `the condition` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the reason`    IS A STRING
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`reason unless` `the condition` `the reason` MEANS
    IF `the condition` THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST `the reason`

-- The reasons, in the clause's own order, for which the insuring clause does not reach an item.
-- Empty where it does.
@ref insuring clause (src:7-19)
GIVEN s IS A `The Schedule`
      l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`why the insuring clause does not reach the item` s l i MEANS
    concat (LIST (`reason unless` (s's `the Insured has paid or agreed to pay the premium`)
                                  "insuring clause: the Insured has neither paid nor agreed to pay the premium")
               , (`reason unless` (`the loss is Damage as defined` l)
                                  "insuring clause: not Damage as defined (physical, and sudden and unforeseen)")
               , (`reason unless` (i's `circumstances`'s `at the insured premises`)
                                  "insuring clause: the property was not at the insured premises")
               , (`reason unless` (`the date falls within the period of insurance or a renewal of it` s (l's `date of the loss`))
                                  "insuring clause: the loss was not in the period of insurance or a renewal of it"))

§§ `The Insurer's election to replace or reinstate`

-- "Bảo Minh cũng có thể chọn cách thay thế hoặc phục hồi": the Insurer MAY replace or
-- reinstate instead of paying. The election is the Insurer's alone and no rule turns on it here;
-- what an election binds the Insurer to spend is General Condition 11 (quantum module).

§ `The proviso: the most the Insurer pays in the period of insurance`

-- "MIỄN LÀ ... tổng trách nhiệm của Bảo Minh trong Thời hạn bảo hiểm sẽ không vượt quá": an
-- AGGREGATE cap over the whole period, not a cap per loss. Limb (i) caps by the total sum insured
-- "hoặc" the sum insured of each item; fork F4 reads the two as both applying. Limb (ii) adds
-- every limit of liability in the Schedule, and says the sums insured are those as amended by
-- endorsements the Insurer confirmed: so `sum insured` in the record is the amended figure.
-- src:20 | MIỄN LÀ, trong mọi trường hợp, tổng trách nhiệm của Bảo Minh trong Thời hạn bảo hiểm sẽ không
-- src:21 | vượt quá:
-- src:22 | (i) tổng số tiền bảo hiểm theo hợp đồng bảo hiểm này hoặc số tiền bảo hiểm tương ứng với mỗi hạng
-- src:23 | mục tài sản được bảo hiểm được kê khai trong Bản tóm lược hợp đồng bảo hiểm
-- src:24 | (ii) mọi giới hạn trách nhiệm được quy định trong Bản tóm lược hợp đồng bảo hiểm, hoặc bất kỳ số
-- src:25 | tiền bảo hiểm nào được sửa đổi bởi các sửa đổi bổ sung đính kèm và được xác nhận bởi Bảo Minh
-- src:26 | hay đại diện cho Bảo Minh.

-- What is left of a cap once what has already been paid against it in the period is deducted.
GIVEN `the cap` IS A NUMBER
      `already paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`what is left of` `the cap` `after` `already paid` MEANS
    IF   `the cap` MINUS `already paid` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN `the cap` MINUS `already paid`
    ELSE 0

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the lesser of` a `and` b MEANS
    IF a AT MOST b THEN a ELSE b

-- Limb (i), per item: the item's sum insured, less what has been paid on it in the period.
@ref proviso, limb (i) (src:22-23)
GIVEN i IS AN `An item in the Schedule`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`limb (i): what is left of the sum insured of the item` i MEANS
    `what is left of` (i's `sum insured`) `after` (i's `already paid on this item in the period of insurance`)

-- Limb (i), for the policy: the total sum insured, less what has been paid in the period.
@ref proviso, limb (i) (src:22)
GIVEN s IS A `The Schedule`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`limb (i): what is left of the total sum insured` s MEANS
    `what is left of` (s's `the total sum insured`) `after` (s's `already paid under this policy in the period`)

-- Limbs (i) and (ii) applied to an amount for the loss as a whole: the total sum insured, and
-- every limit of liability the Schedule states for the loss.
@ref proviso, limbs (i) and (ii) (src:20-26)
GIVEN s IS A `The Schedule`
      `the amount` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the proviso applied to` s `the amount` MEANS
    foldr (GIVEN lim, acc YIELD `the lesser of` acc `and` (`what is left of` (lim's `amount`) `after` (lim's `already paid against it`)))
          (`the lesser of` `the amount` `and` (`limb (i): what is left of the total sum insured` s))
          (s's `the limits of liability`)
